    "Jeden přítel, který denně uvidí, kolik slibů máš splněno, a ty jeho. Nic víc." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One friend who sees every day how many of your promises are done, and you see theirs. Nothing more."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jeden slib zůstal otevřený. Uzavři ho a skóre se zvedne." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One promise is still open. Close it and your score goes up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jeden z vás už má plný počet parťáků." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One of you already has the maximum number of buddies."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jeden z vás už parťáka má." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One of you already has a buddy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jeden úkol" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One task"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jeden úkol nebo plus u dne otevře editor: název, kategorie, čas, délka, priorita i deadline." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One task, or the plus next to a day, opens the editor: name, category, time, length, priority and deadline."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jedna aktivita na víc dní" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One activity on several days"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jedna otázka denně, nálada a tři řádky. Pro ty, kdo chtějí víc než čísla." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One question a day, your mood and three lines. For those who want more than numbers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jedna věta do deníku: co ti dnes šlo?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One line for the diary: what went well today?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jedno zaváhání nic nekazí. Škodí až časté vynechávání, proto tu vidíš, kolik dní, ne jen sérii." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One slip doesn't ruin anything. What hurts is skipping often, which is why you see how many days, not just the streak."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jednoduchý" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Simple"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jednoručky" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dumbbells"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jedním klepnutím. Buď k sobě upřímný." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One tap. Be honest with yourself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jel jsem i břicho" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I did abs too"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jen deník, zbytek aplikace zůstane otevřený." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Just the diary; the rest of the app stays open."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jen fotoaparátem, nic se neukládá do galerie. Fotky jsou šifrované v telefonu, nejdou do iCloudu ani do zálohy a při smazání aplikace zmizí." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Camera only; nothing is saved to your library. The photos are encrypted on your phone, never go to iCloud or backups, and disappear when you delete the app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jen orientační cíl: jeden týden 3×, druhý 6× je v pořádku, žádný postih. Jak ho plníš, se trochu promítá do spolehlivosti a podle něj ti Kept gym navrhuje. Změníš ho v Nastavení gymu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Just a rough goal: 3× one week and 6× the next is fine, no penalty. How you keep it shows a little in your reliability, and Kept suggests the gym based on it. Change it in Gym settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jen tentokrát" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Just this once"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jen v tomto telefonu, zašifrované, mimo zálohy a galerii." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only on this phone, encrypted, outside backups and the library."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jen v tomto zařízení" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only on this device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jen částečně" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only partly"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ještě %lld×" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld× more"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ještě ne" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Not yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JEŠTĚ NE" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "NOT YET"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ještě se nestalo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hasn't happened yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ještě to dnes stihneš." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can still make it today."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ještě to dnes stihnu" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I'll still make it today"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jiné" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Other"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jiný" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Other"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jiný cvik" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Another exercise"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jiný den" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Another day"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jméno" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jméno jde změnit nejvýš jednou za 7 dní. Čtyři čísla zůstanou, pokud jsou u nového jména volná." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can change your name at most once every 7 days. The four digits stay if they're free with the new name."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jméno jde změnit zase %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can change your name again %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jméno jsi měnil/a nedávno. Zkus to později." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You changed your name recently. Try again later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jméno má mít 1 až 24 znaků a nesmí v něm být odkaz." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The name needs 1 to 24 characters and can't contain a link."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jméno má mít 1 až 24 znaků." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The name needs 1 to 24 characters."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jméno pro přátele" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Name for friends"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jméno se nepodařilo změnit. Zkontroluj připojení." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn't change the name. Check your connection."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jméno se nepodařilo změnit. Zkus to prosím znovu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Couldn't change the name. Please try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jsem v Kept jako %@. Najdeš mě podle tohohle označení." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "I'm on Kept as %@. You can find me by this tag."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jsi přes plánovaný čas a deadline máš v %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You're past the planned time and your deadline is at %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jóga" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yoga"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "K tomuhle cviku zatím nic nemáme. Vytvoř si ho jako vlastní cvik s fotkou a poznámkami." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "We don't have anything for this exercise yet. Create it as your own exercise with a photo and notes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "K tomuhle ses zavázal. Odstranění se počítá jako porušený slib a zůstane v historii." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You committed to this. Removing it counts as a broken promise and stays in your history."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kalendář" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Calendar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kalendář iPhonu" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPhone calendar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kalendář série" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Streak calendar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kamarád ho naskenuje foťákem v iPhonu a otevře se Kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your friend scans it with the iPhone camera and Kept opens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kamarád ho naskenuje v Kept tlačítkem níže, nebo foťákem v iPhonu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your friend scans it in Kept with the button below, or with the iPhone camera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kategorie" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Category"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Každou hodinu v neděli, dokud neodešleš plánovač na příští týden." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every hour on Sunday until you send next week's planner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Každý den máš na obrazovce Dnes svoje úkoly. Hotovo, částečně, nebo přeskočit. Za splněný závazek dostaneš 100 bodů, za částečný jen jeho díl." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every day your tasks are on the Today screen. Done, partly, or skip. A kept commitment earns 100 points, a partial one just its share."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "každých %lld min" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "every %lld min"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kde chceš být za měsíc? Co si teď slibuješ? Co by sis měl připomenout?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Where do you want to be in a month? What are you promising yourself now? What should you remind yourself of?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kde jsi dnes dodržel slovo, i když se ti nechtělo?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Where did you keep your word today even though you didn't feel like it?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kde ses dnes vyhnul práci?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Where did you dodge work today?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kdo bude mít na konci tohoto týdne vyšší spolehlivost, vyhrává. Při shodě se vklady vrátí." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Whoever has the higher reliability at the end of this week wins. If it's a tie, the stakes are returned."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kdo cíl splní první, klepne „Splnil jsem“. Když to ostatní potvrdí, vyhrává. Když to někdo rozporuje, vklady se vrátí." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Whoever reaches the goal first taps “Done it”. If the others confirm, they win. If someone disputes it, the stakes are returned."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kdo hraje" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Who's playing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kdo to potvrdí?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Who will confirm it?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kdy" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kdy ses dnes cítil nejvíc v plném nasazení?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When did you feel most fully engaged today?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kdy ti má Kept psát?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When should Kept write to you?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kdy ti to jde" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When it goes well"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KDY TO ZAČNEŠ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "WHEN YOU'LL START"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Když Apple Health zaznamená silový trénink, pošle ti Kept upozornění, ze kterého ho rovnou zapíšeš." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When Apple Health records a strength workout, Kept sends you a notification to log it straight away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Když hodinky uloží silový trénink, Kept ti hned nabídne ho zapsat" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When your watch saves a strength workout, Kept offers to log it right away"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep what you promise." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Keep what you promise."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KEPT" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KEPT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept data ze Zdraví jen čte a nikam je neposílá." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kept only reads data from Health and never sends it anywhere."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept doporučuje" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kept suggests"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept hlídá, připomíná a počítá spolehlivost. Výmluvy si musíš obhájit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kept watches, reminds and keeps score of your reliability. Excuses have to hold up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept je zamčený" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kept is locked"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept jen čte: váhu doplní do zápisu tréninku a do grafu, a když Health zaznamená trénink, nabídne ti rovnou splnění Gymu. Nic do Health nezapisuje. Oprávnění změníš v aplikaci Zdraví." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kept only reads: it adds your weight to the workout log and the chart, and when Health records a workout, it offers to complete your Gym task. It never writes to Health. You can change permissions in the Health app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept nemohl načíst tvoje uložená data, a tak začal s čistou databází. Původní soubory jsou uschované a nic se nesmazalo, takže jdou ještě obnovit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kept couldn't load your saved data, so it started with a clean database. The original files are kept safe and nothing was deleted, so they can still be restored."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept nemá ke kalendáři přístup. Povol ho v Nastavení iPhonu → Aplikace → Kept → Kalendáře (úplný přístup)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kept doesn't have access to your calendar. Allow it in iPhone Settings → Apps → Kept → Calendars (full access)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept nemá přístup k fotoaparátu. Povol ho v Nastavení a QR kód naskenuješ přímo tady." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kept doesn't have access to the camera. Allow it in Settings and you can scan the QR code right here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept nemá přístup k mikrofonu nebo k rozpoznávání řeči. Povol je v Nastavení iPhonu → Aplikace → Kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kept doesn't have access to the microphone or speech recognition. Allow them in iPhone Settings → Apps → Kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept není seznam úkolů. Je to smlouva se sebou samým." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kept isn't a to-do list. It's a contract with yourself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept obsahuje tvoje selhání i deník. Můžeš ho schovat za Face ID." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kept holds your misses and your diary. You can hide it behind Face ID."
          }
