    "Plánovač je pod minimem %lld aktivit. Když ho nedoplníš, nezapečetí se a vrátí se ti jako návrh." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The planner is below the minimum of %lld activities. If you don't add more, it won't seal and comes back to you as a draft."
