    "ÚČET JE VOLITELNÝ" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "THE ACCOUNT IS OPTIONAL"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Účet je volitelný a Kept funguje i bez něj. Deník, váha, zdraví a fotky zůstanou jen v tvém telefonu a nic se nesdílí, dokud to sám nezapneš. Účet založíš i později v Nastavení." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The account is optional and Kept works without it too. Your diary, weight, health data and photos stay only on your phone, and nothing is shared until you turn it on yourself. You can also create an account later in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
